    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomodakill</strong> is a free multiplayer shooter based on one of the largest Twitch Italy communities. You can play as your favorite streamer and jump into action!<br><br><strong>Two teams</strong> of <strong>6 players</strong> will face off in a fast-paced <strong>Deathmatch</strong>. The battles will take place on <strong>3 different maps</strong>, small and chaotic, full of nooks and secrets. <strong>Weapons</strong> and <strong>healing</strong> items will be found on the ground, and the action will be even more intense thanks to the many <strong>Jumpads</strong>! The first team to reach 30 kills wins. What are you waiting for? <strong>Dive in!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomodakill</strong> is a free multiplayer shooter based on one of the largest Twitch Italy communities. You can play as your favorite streamer and jump into action!<br><br><strong>Two teams</strong> of <strong>6 players</strong> will face off in a fast-paced <strong>Deathmatch</strong>. The battles will take place on <strong>3 different maps</strong>, small and chaotic, full of nooks and secrets. <strong>Weapons</strong> and <strong>healing</strong> items will be found on the ground, and the action will be even more intense thanks to the many <strong>Jumpads</strong>! The first team to reach 30 kills wins. What are you waiting for? <strong>Dive in!</strong></p>",
